          {
            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 127604,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir <code>for</code> döngüsü kullanarak bir dizinin tüm öğeleri arasında döngü oluşturmanın kolay bir yolu vardır.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finalScores = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"34\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finalScores {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(score)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"22\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"34\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"13\" /></content></output></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Four executions",
            "id": 127605,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>finalScores</code> dizisindeki öğeler arasında döngü oluşturmak için <code>for</code>, <code>score</code> gibi bir değişken, <code>in</code> sözcüğü ve <code>finalScores</code> dizisini yazarız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finalScores = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"34\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finalScores {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(score)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"60\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"22\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"34\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"13\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>for</code>, ardından <code>score</code> ve sonra <code>in</code>, <code>finalScores</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Length",
            "id": 127606,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Döngü, dizide kaç öğe varsa o kadar kez çalışacak. Burada <code>print(score)</code> kodunu yazarak konsolda dört öğe göreceğiz.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finalScores = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"34\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finalScores {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(score)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"77\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"22\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"34\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"13\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>print(score)</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "for",
            "id": 127607,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>in</code> ifadesinden önceki değişken, döngünün o anda üzerinde bulunduğu liste öğesinin değerini tutar. Burada değişken olarak <code>artist</code> kullanacağız.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" artists = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Chagall&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lissitzky&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" artist \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" artists {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(artist)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;----&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"51\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Chagall\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"----\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Lissitzky\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"----\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>for</code>, ardından <code>artist</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
