            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Swift'te <code>supplies</code> listesiyle bir for döngüsü oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" supplies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;pencil&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" value \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" supplies {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(value)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"pencil\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"book\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>for</code>, ardından <code>in</code> ve son olarak <code>supplies</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
